  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1759889598_758291_9f74f18287d221fb2d70d0b6af531e0d.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">• About our brand and products:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>GVM is a dedicated brand for professional photography and video lighting. We offer a wide range of high-quality LED lights, from compact on-camera lights to studio-grade panels and RGB creative fixtures, trusted by content creators, filmmakers, and photographers worldwide.</span></p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">• What makes us different:</strong><br>We stand out with reliable build quality, innovative lighting effects (such as RGB and special scene modes), and user-friendly designs at competitive prices. Our commitment to customer support and continuous improvement makes GVM a go-to choice for creators who want professional results without overpaying.</span></p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn a <strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">5% commission</strong> on every sale generated through their unique link. Additionally, you can offer your audience a <strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">5% discount coupon</strong>, which helps increase conversion rates. Both the coupon and commission are simple, transparent, and recurring for every qualifying purchase.</span></p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">• How to promote us:</strong><br>You can promote GVM products through YouTube reviews and tutorials, Instagram or TikTok lighting showcases, blog posts, email newsletters, or live streaming setups. We provide banners, product images, and tracking links. The 5% discount code makes it easy to encourage your audience to try GVM.</span></p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin:16px 0px;color:rgb(15,17,21);font-family:'quote-cjk-patch', Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">• Other information:</strong><br>We track sales with reliable affiliate platforms and offer on-time payouts. You'll get dedicated support and updates on new products and seasonal campaigns. Whether you're a small creator or a large influencer, joining GVM’s affiliate program is straightforward — just sign up, get your link and coupon, and start earning.</span></p></div></div>",
